    "8": {
      "note": "A Send aimed at an archived or placeholder explainer first asks that leaf’s fixed-target first-request form to open with the current text and collected picks. If no live target remains, no role-chat post or settlement occurs and the collection stays; a mixed selection continues through ordinary live-target posting and settlement. This handoff is not reported as native delivery. The minimized line’s head also expands on a click, Enter or space outside a nested control; the nested button, link, input, textarea, select and listed ARIA control targets retain their own actions, so Close does not also expand. The existing closed-column minimized-pick rule remains separate from the explicit first-request signal that opens its matching column.",
